sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Client
    box rgb(235, 245, 255) Services
        participant A as API
        participant W as Worker
    end
    C->>+A: Request
    Note over C,W: Shared context<br/>multiple lines
    rect rgb(240, 250, 240)
        par Work
            A->>+W: Start
            W-->>-A: Done
        and Audit
            A->>A: Record
        end
        opt Retry enabled
            loop At most twice
                A->>W: Retry
                W-->>A: Done
            end
        end
    end
    critical Commit
        A->>W: Commit
    option Timeout
        A-->>C: Retry later
    end
    break Invalid request
        A--xC: Abort
    end
    A-->>-C: Complete
